# Vite logs files
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*

# Ride-log encryption. The private key is the ONLY thing that can read the
# sealed logs — it must never leave the laptop, and never reach the repo or the
# Pi. The public key is cryptographically safe to publish, but it is specific to
# one laptop and this is a public repo, so keep both out.
*.private.pem
*.public.pem
ride-log-key.private.pem
ride-logs/
*.celog
